iew` TUI rendering in narrow/resized terminals by making both the dashboard and detail views **display-width aware** (cell-based truncation/padding) and by sanitizing agent text to strip ANSI/control sequences before rendering.\\n> \\n> The dashboard now derives preview column width from the current terminal width, clamps every rendered line to that width, and adds regression tests covering very small widths, window resizes, wide characters/emoji, and control-sequence leakage. It also adds a test to pin sink ordering so the `TUISink` runs before post-run writers like `DumpSink`/`SynthesisSink`.\\n> \\n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 9044dc5393a07a4d7d8f5fa14e81c90dc61c3636. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\", \"title\": \"Fix review TUI wrapping\", \"base\": \"main\", \"base_sha\": \"018edea7216d17c3bf3c2a0a719d00c8aff802ac\", \"head\": \"fix-review\", \"head_sha\": \"9044dc5393a07a4d7d8f5fa14e81c90dc61c3636\", \"merge_commit_sha\": \"a383e54267c1c86552a343da1b88ae2f20935ac3\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"peyton-alt\", \"name\": \"peyton-alt\", \"email\": null, \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/249787869?v=4\", \"id\": 249787869}, \"requested_reviewers\": [{\"login\": \"Copilot\", \"name\": \"Copilot\", \"email\": null, \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/946600?v=4\", \"id\": 175728472}], \"requested_team_reviewers\": null, \"diff\": null, \"comments\": null, \"created_at\": \"2026-05-08T14:39:28Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-05-08T14:39:59Z\", \"closed_at\": null, \"merged_at\": null, \"commits\": 1, \"changed_files\": 6, \"additions\": 259, \"deletions\": 54, \"display_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1158\", \"display_title\": \"Fix review TUI wrapping\"}"}],"structuredContent":{"url":"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1158","number":1158,"state":"open","merged":false,"mergeable":true,"draft":true,"body":"## 